# Dack Fayden -6: the emblem's "Whenever you cast a spell that targets one or more permanents, gain control of those
# permanents." Dack climbs by +1s from turn 1 (the -6 is refused at 5 on turn 5 and allowed at 6 on turn 7). Turn 7:
# Bot1's Lightning Bolt at Bot2 itself targets no permanent, nothing is taken; a second Bolt at Bot2's Concealing Curtains
# (a 0/4) makes the emblem take it first, so it is Bot1's with 3 damage on it. Turn 8: Bot2's Snakeskin Veil on its own
# Ornithopter targets a permanent but is not Bot1's spell: Bot2 keeps it.

